# LeakSanitizer suppressions for builds with IMPRESARIO_SANITIZERS=address.
# Only third-party code that allocates once per process and never frees it
# belongs here; a leak in Plasma Impresario code is a bug to fix instead.
# See docs/sanitizers.md.

# Chromium inside Qt WebEngine keeps process-lifetime caches and singletons that
# it never frees; every reported stack ends in a page load started by a test.
leak:libQt6WebEngineCore.so
